{"id": "85868", "name": "CR-Diff-04-product-2.g", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0.1, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "questiontext": "Find the following derivative:\n\\[ \\frac{d}{d{{CT:0}}}[{{CT:1}}]. \\]\n\n[[input:ans1]] [[validation:ans1]]\n", "generalfeedback": "In order to solve this problem we will have to use the product rule <hint>calc_product_rule</hint> as follows:\n\n\\[\\begin{array}{rcl}\\displaystyle\n  \\frac{d}{d{{CT:0}}}[{{CT:1}}] &\\displaystyle =&\\displaystyle  \\left[\\frac{d}{d{{CT:0}}}[{{CT:2}}]\\right]\\cdot {{CT:3}} + {{CT:2}}\\cdot \\left[\\frac{d}{d{{CT:0}}}[{{CT:3}}]\\right] \\\\\n   &\\displaystyle =&\\displaystyle  {{CT:4}}\\cdot {{CT:3}} + {{CT:2}}\\cdot [{{CT:5}}] \\\\\n   &\\displaystyle =&\\displaystyle  {{CT:6}}\n \\end{array}\\] ", "specificfeedback": "<p>[[feedback:Result]]</p>", "prtcorrect": "<span class='correct'>Correct answer, well done.</span>", "prtpartiallycorrect": "<span class='partially'>Your answer is partially correct.</span>", "prtincorrect": "<span class='incorrect'>Incorrect answer.</span>", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 15, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "Result", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "Diff", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "diff(p,v)", "testoptions": "v", "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-0-T ", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": 1, "answernote": "Result-0-F ", "feedback": ""}}, {"name": 1, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "diff(pp1,v)*diff(pp2,v)", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false,